        "type": "slimmer",
        "tekst": "**In plain words**\n\nOld sociology was mostly written by white Western men. New perspectives add other voices (women, minorities, colonised peoples, LGBTQ people, disabled people) and accept that every view is partial. Postmodernists say there's no single big story anymore; the world is fast, mixed and uncertain."
